# Design System — CADS first

Lab2 UI in this kit uses **packaged CADS** as the source of truth: `@moshebari/cads-react` and `@moshebari/cads-variables`.

Bootstrap is already in `src/components/lab2/CadsLabProvider.tsx` (`CadsProvider baseline={false}` + Foundations CSS + icon fonts). `Lab2Shell` wraps every lab route.

## New UI

1. Import components from `@moshebari/cads-react` (and `FaIcon` from `@moshebari/cads-react/icons`).
2. Only use components and props listed in `cadsManifest`.
3. Style with **unprefixed Foundations** variables from `@moshebari/cads-variables`:
   `--background-*`, `--text-*`, `--border-*`, `--shape-*`, `--spacing-p-*`, `--font-family-*`.
4. No hex literals. Do not invent props (`color="purple"`, `intent="danger"`).
5. Do **not** add new `--ds-*` or local `App*` usage on Lab2 surfaces.
6. Brand = CTAs / links / primary actions. Selected chrome is not brand fill.

Catalog: `/design-system/cads`. Figma: CodeAI Design System (CADS). Skill: `.cursor/skills/cads-prototyping/SKILL.md`.

## Leftover `--ds-*`

`src/styles/tokens.css` still exists for CodeMirror syntax (`--ds-syntax-*`) and a few unmigrated internals. Do not expand it. If a CADS Foundations variable exists, use that instead of a `--ds-*` alias.

Never use mapped aliases (`--foreground`, `--background`, `--card`, `--primary`, …) in component styles.

## Typography

Prefer CADS text styles (see `src/guidelines/typography.md`). Do not hard-code `px` font sizes or font family names when a token exists.
